---
---
<figure class="factory-plate">
  <div class="factory-plate__heading">
    <span>PLATE 01</span>
    <span>THE FACTORY REMEMBERS</span>
    <span>28.09.26</span>
  </div>
  <svg class="factory-plate__map" viewBox="0 0 820 476" role="img" aria-labelledby="factory-plate-title factory-plate-desc">
    <title id="factory-plate-title">From intent to evidence</title>
    <desc id="factory-plate-desc">A reviewed request moves through agent work, qualification and release. A separate reality check observes the software in use and returns evidence to the factory.</desc>
    <defs>
      <pattern id="plate-grid" width="24" height="24" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <path d="M24 0H0V24" fill="none" stroke="#58635a" stroke-opacity=".26" stroke-width=".55" />
      </pattern>
      <marker id="arrow-brass" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="7" refY="4.5" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0 0L8 4.5 0 9" fill="none" stroke="#c6a96a" stroke-width="1.2" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <rect x="1" y="1" width="818" height="474" fill="url(#plate-grid)" stroke="#5d655d" stroke-width="1" />
    <path d="M62 97H758M62 97V391M758 97V391M62 391H758" fill="none" stroke="#777a6e" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 6" />
    <path d="M130 195H284M338 195H488M542 195H690" fill="none" stroke="#c6a96a" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow-brass)" />
    <path d="M716 235V322H410V248" fill="none" stroke="#9c5b4c" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="5 5" marker-end="url(#arrow-brass)" />

    <g class="plate-node">
      <rect x="52" y="139" width="132" height="112" />
      <text x="68" y="166" class="plate-micro">01 / REQUEST</text>
      <text x="68" y="199" class="plate-title">Human</text>
      <text x="68" y="220" class="plate-copy">Intent &amp; authority</text>
    </g>
    <g class="plate-node">
      <rect x="246" y="139" width="132" height="112" />
      <text x="262" y="166" class="plate-micro">02 / DECOMPOSE</text>
      <text x="262" y="199" class="plate-title">Agents</text>
      <text x="262" y="220" class="plate-copy">Bounded work</text>
    </g>
    <g class="plate-node">
      <rect x="438" y="139" width="132" height="112" />
      <text x="454" y="166" class="plate-micro">03 / QUALIFY</text>
      <text x="454" y="199" class="plate-title">Review</text>
      <text x="454" y="220" class="plate-copy">Evidence &amp; judgement</text>
    </g>
    <g class="plate-node">
      <rect x="630" y="139" width="132" height="112" />
      <text x="646" y="166" class="plate-micro">04 / RELEASE</text>
      <text x="646" y="199" class="plate-title">Production</text>
      <text x="646" y="220" class="plate-copy">Exact state</text>
    </g>

    <g class="plate-return">
      <rect x="302" y="328" width="218" height="94" />
      <text x="322" y="354" class="plate-micro">05 / REALITY</text>
      <text x="322" y="386" class="plate-title">Use it. Observe.</text>
      <text x="322" y="405" class="plate-copy">Physical proof when the work leaves a screen.</text>
    </g>
    <text x="53" y="72" class="plate-note">A SOFTWARE FACTORY IS A SYSTEM FOR TURNING INTENT INTO OBSERVABLE OUTCOMES.</text>
    <text x="556" y="366" class="plate-micro">EVIDENCE RETURNS TO THE RECORD</text>
    <text x="53" y="449" class="plate-index">WOODHOUSE TECHNICAL PLATE · 01</text>
    <text x="657" y="449" class="plate-index">NOT ALL PROOF IS SOFTWARE</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <span>Every stage makes a different claim.</span>
    <span>Implementation does not stand in for release. Release does not stand in for physical proof.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
